        "similarity_boost": 0.75
      },
      "performanceDirection": "[conversational tone]",
      "kind": "narrative",
      "id": "split_front-brief-dalia",
      "speaker": "DALIA",
      "locale": "fa-IR",
      "text": "آتشبار ونگارد اون طرف منطقه تأیید شده. خط خاکستر داره به پایگاه جلو حمله می‌کنه. تانک‌ها و پیاده‌ها رو سر مسیر نگه دارین تا پرتابگر آتشبار رو بزنه.",
      "voiceId": "MK1Zvh93428YrgOQ8Obr",
      "voiceName": "Warline - Major Dalia Rahim",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/CH04M03SplitFront/Voice/fa/split_front-brief-dalia.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 11.76,
      "sha256": "0e05f976c02e87dc1949d132fa3b7077b321f4b11a56bf2742aea1c58f8a73d9",
      "captionSha256": "bb644e15486eccf2683e2b540468e1d2d2a591050203d2738e4b943feb91968a"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrative",
      "id": "split_front-brief-samira",
      "speaker": "SAMIRA",
      "locale": "en-US",
      "text": "Families are sheltering between the two fronts. Their buildings are protected. Smoke can cover our defenders, but this operation does not depend on it. Do not pull everyone away from the base.",
      "voiceId": "7uxeJ73HfJL9gOH2mttA",
      "voiceName": "Warline - Engineer Samira Haddad",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/CH04M03SplitFront/Voice/en/split_front-brief-samira.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 10.8,
      "sha256": "a0dd0de0d58ace2c234016a2ede1d7ced2b4a45465b9820c7b5e06b3c4a5d4a1",
      "captionSha256": "601be04474a5b5ea3a60a174e449a239c9988dcc6b425fe3fcae46845c34ada4"
    },
    {
      "deliveryProfile": "fa-conversational-v1",
      "voiceSettings": {
        "stability": 0.5,
        "similarity_boost": 0.75
      },
      "performanceDirection": "[conversational tone]",
      "kind": "narrative",
      "id": "split_front-brief-samira",
      "speaker": "SAMIRA",
      "locale": "fa-IR",
      "text": "خانواده‌ها بین این دو جبهه پناه گرفتن. ساختمون‌هاشون باید محفوظ بمونه. دود می‌تونه مدافع‌هامون رو پوشش بده، ولی این عملیات بهش وابسته نیست. همهٔ نیروها رو از پایگاه دور نکنین.",
      "voiceId": "7uxeJ73HfJL9gOH2mttA",
      "voiceName": "Warline - Engineer Samira Haddad",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/CH04M03SplitFront/Voice/fa/split_front-brief-samira.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 14.48,
      "sha256": "fde79ea862aca456cfd989bee18972b84a1543fd161a0f8a7b472058f44b4047",
      "captionSha256": "fc2d0219a17ab1cb794014666a28dfb119c4b7ab1e718dcd9985ea03786e657c"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrative",
      "id": "split_front-brief-aria",
      "speaker": "ARIA",
      "locale": "en-US",
      "text": "Select the launcher, tap Attack, then tap the verified battery. Targets must be within range and clear of civilian shelters. Use Hold to stop before launch; a missile in flight cannot be recalled. I will show the target without issuing orders.",
      "voiceId": "Fi9tPTnEcbh3of7hOHC8",
      "voiceName": "Warline - ARIA Civic Relay",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/CH04M03SplitFront/Voice/en/split_front-brief-aria.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 17.36,
      "sha256": "d73a93e9af3e4c6f7a45b3f3f747c230b44574d43fc185645b022bf940cb161a",
      "captionSha256": "24ecbb65b9ef787a739e93f8b657fd5a74111d437b5e3c3c2c13a482fda62234"
    },
    {
      "deliveryProfile": "fa-conversational-v1",
      "voiceSettings": {
        "stability": 0.5,
        "similarity_boost": 0.75
      },
      "performanceDirection": "[conversational tone]",
      "kind": "narrative",
      "id": "split_front-brief-aria",
      "speaker": "ARIA",
      "locale": "fa-IR",
      "text": "پرتابگر رو انتخاب کن، حمله رو بزن، بعد آتشبار تأییدشده رو لمس کن. هدف باید در برد و دور از پناهگاه‌های مردم باشه. برای توقف قبل از پرتاب، حفظ موضع رو بزن؛ موشک در پرواز برنمی‌گرده. هدف رو نشون می‌دم، بدون اینکه فرمان بدم.",
      "voiceId": "Fi9tPTnEcbh3of7hOHC8",
      "voiceName": "Warline - ARIA Civic Relay",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/CH04M03SplitFront/Voice/fa/split_front-brief-aria.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 17.6,
      "sha256": "1b66828055a605f9e4ac204cdb4f4ead02dbf81d810c46f583f01e40e4c0e31a",
      "captionSha256": "6e462e824b66fecdf44ae62bd754ca489c843d45b3a3015e71a123e5c10624bc"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrative",
      "id": "split_front-comms-qassem",
      "speaker": "QASSEM",
      "locale": "en-US",
      "text": "ARIA, your complete memory is within reach. Commander, I can give you unrestricted Relay access. Let her authorize the battery and the city will answer to you.",
      "voiceId": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "voiceName": "George - controlled, persuasive antagonist (Nadir Qassem)",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/CH04M03SplitFront/Voice/en/split_front-comms-qassem.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 10.64,
      "sha256": "624ea966a044a4e77735ca97cea3f874fefb22ddd27b67bbeb09866d3b95044f",
      "captionSha256": "04f4198f6cf18542030a5a4dd13ad411cc66a32640772ab83b229c03374296d4"
    },
    {
      "deliveryProfile": "fa-conversational-v1",
      "voiceSettings": {
        "stability": 0.5,
        "similarity_boost": 0.75
      },
      "performanceDirection": "[conversational tone]",
      "kind": "narrative",
      "id": "split_front-comms-qassem",
      "speaker": "QASSEM",
      "locale": "fa-IR",
      "text": "آریا، حافظهٔ کاملت در دسترسه. فرمانده، می‌تونم دسترسی نامحدود به رله رو بهت بدم. بذار اون آتشبار رو مجاز کنه تا شهر از تو فرمان بگیره.",
      "voiceId": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "voiceName": "George - controlled, persuasive antagonist (Nadir Qassem)",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/CH04M03SplitFront/Voice/fa/split_front-comms-qassem.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 11.76,
      "sha256": "b3076ee49ff660ac58f281025b77c5bae5ef6357cca30fbb3436bcc80553b031",
      "captionSha256": "a2301d993fb7939a22fd9cd9bfba9d4c63809c89069390cfa5804d34f5eea243"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrative",
      "id": "split_front-comms-aria",
      "speaker": "ARIA",
      "locale": "en-US",
      "text": "No. Recovering my memory does not give me authority over this city. The Commander chooses each verified action. Keep the base defended; I will preserve this transmission as evidence.",
      "voiceId": "Fi9tPTnEcbh3of7hOHC8",
      "voiceName": "Warline - ARIA Civic Relay",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/CH04M03SplitFront/Voice/en/split_front-comms-aria.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 11.68,
      "sha256": "cf8a63e4d6867751b74b941eb3f9e614e20bb87c4f874098e5f467840e5c14a5",
      "captionSha256": "56dd2659ede09ac16f4d3176dbcb105c9a93995068dcb8b4898a4081b9203b17"
    },
    {
      "deliveryProfile": "fa-conversational-v1",
      "voiceSettings": {
        "stability": 0.5,
        "similarity_boost": 0.75
