      "performanceDirection": "[conversational tone]",
      "kind": "narrative",
      "id": "split_front-comms-aria",
      "speaker": "ARIA",
      "locale": "fa-IR",
      "text": "نه. بازیابی حافظه‌ام به من اختیار این شهر رو نمی‌ده. فرمانده هر اقدام تأییدشده رو خودش انتخاب می‌کنه. دفاع پایگاه رو حفظ کن؛ این پیام رو به عنوان مدرک نگه می‌دارم.",
      "voiceId": "Fi9tPTnEcbh3of7hOHC8",
      "voiceName": "Warline - ARIA Civic Relay",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/CH04M03SplitFront/Voice/fa/split_front-comms-aria.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 12.24,
      "sha256": "39e557cbce3c2bd1ad90fed59fabd7dff70b36f6403d35c14ccfae1197c439a8",
      "captionSha256": "7de59cc9fd40c233722512488a418b1ed103c666eb37795b1aee5dc5d9491d30"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrative",
      "id": "split_front-debrief-samira",
      "speaker": "SAMIRA",
      "locale": "en-US",
      "text": "The battery is silent and the forward base is holding. The shelters are safe. Keeping defenders on the second front protected the people between them.",
      "voiceId": "7uxeJ73HfJL9gOH2mttA",
      "voiceName": "Warline - Engineer Samira Haddad",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/CH04M03SplitFront/Voice/en/split_front-debrief-samira.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 7.76,
      "sha256": "a9376a78a2262145adc68738cde70e50c8642c346a0c739089fae8c0cce44171",
      "captionSha256": "32c01a7c19877f70b5a7dd7e882cb9e9e3dfcf535556304b99b765ea273bd8b8"
    },
    {
      "deliveryProfile": "fa-conversational-v1",
      "voiceSettings": {
        "stability": 0.5,
        "similarity_boost": 0.75
      },
      "performanceDirection": "[conversational tone]",
      "kind": "narrative",
      "id": "split_front-debrief-samira",
      "speaker": "SAMIRA",
      "locale": "fa-IR",
      "text": "آتشبار خاموش شده و پایگاه جلو پابرجاست. پناهگاه‌ها امنن. نگه داشتن مدافع‌ها در جبههٔ دوم، مردم بین این دو جبهه رو حفظ کرد.",
      "voiceId": "7uxeJ73HfJL9gOH2mttA",
      "voiceName": "Warline - Engineer Samira Haddad",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/CH04M03SplitFront/Voice/fa/split_front-debrief-samira.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 10.08,
      "sha256": "fb7d26cf45ea38f421ce898c4852195b8465c9da97b4cc608aca528587eba9ac",
      "captionSha256": "60d0b9fbb2bd2d565e894b09c12199a473fd11d87e2c4da20ae324c98b948ffb"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrative",
      "id": "split_front-debrief-dalia",
      "speaker": "DALIA",
      "locale": "en-US",
      "text": "The battery's targeting package was built to request ARIA's authorization. This is imported Relay-compatible hardware. Its supply trail leads to an air-support site.",
      "voiceId": "MK1Zvh93428YrgOQ8Obr",
      "voiceName": "Warline - Major Dalia Rahim",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/CH04M03SplitFront/Voice/en/split_front-debrief-dalia.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 10.8,
      "sha256": "cbbe4ae7baf277c1eededbcbd6d7e2835a8582245171faa9b7ea4f846bc7a5fa",
      "captionSha256": "482fcb38d71b9d48f9713ef6ac5b5bde67c567c788bd1389d3cd59a18b963315"
    },
    {
      "deliveryProfile": "fa-conversational-v1",
      "voiceSettings": {
        "stability": 0.5,
        "similarity_boost": 0.75
      },
      "performanceDirection": "[conversational tone]",
      "kind": "narrative",
      "id": "split_front-debrief-dalia",
      "speaker": "DALIA",
      "locale": "fa-IR",
      "text": "بستهٔ هدف‌گیری آتشبار طوری ساخته شده که مجوز آریا رو بخواد. این تجهیزات وارداتی با رله سازگارن. رد تأمینشون به یک مرکز پشتیبانی هوایی می‌رسه.",
      "voiceId": "MK1Zvh93428YrgOQ8Obr",
      "voiceName": "Warline - Major Dalia Rahim",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/CH04M03SplitFront/Voice/fa/split_front-debrief-dalia.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 13.2,
      "sha256": "fa708642dc1e68af2ed1de6a954d133ecd00c68d8542c849c4417d8a92fd496a",
      "captionSha256": "aa66d141af602bcfd2783550573e1e96695a10c6fb77e2c1d5512ee1455adcbc"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrative",
      "id": "split_front-debrief-aria",
      "speaker": "ARIA",
      "locale": "en-US",
      "text": "I have preserved the targeting package and Qassem's offer. Neither grants autonomous authority. The evidence points to the air-support site; your next operation will decide how we approach it.",
      "voiceId": "Fi9tPTnEcbh3of7hOHC8",
      "voiceName": "Warline - ARIA Civic Relay",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/CH04M03SplitFront/Voice/en/split_front-debrief-aria.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 12.16,
      "sha256": "8078a4e964ef69741deaab28c7078ab7ea519ad762c6aa4a13471c7573ec70ae",
      "captionSha256": "0c3c0116878adcf326337ea00fd8f38e9d703186b88d395a4ed8abb068129643"
    },
    {
      "deliveryProfile": "fa-conversational-v1",
